{"id":"input-686a9a6f5ba3","steamAppId":"1195560","name":"Alek - The Lost Kingdom","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/e6b38ddf6f10a75625a36ff85a7004c9842c6e8b/library_capsule.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195560/","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Strategy","Early Access"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":6.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"6 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-686a9a6f5ba3","canonicalId":"steam-app-1195560","suppliedName":"Alek - The Lost Kingdom","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/e6b38ddf6f10a75625a36ff85a7004c9842c6e8b/library_capsule.jpg","officialName":"Alek - The Lost Kingdom","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2021,"developers":["Jessy Lemieux"],"publishers":["Blackmyers Studio"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Strategy","Early Access"],"shortDescription":"Alek, the young man who will change Zarabon's World forever. In this adventure, you must rebuild the world of Zarabon in your image. Build villages and manage your production lines with the help of your villagers.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"1195560"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195560/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T09:56:27.790Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T09:56:27.790Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1195560","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195560/","officialWebsite":"http://blackmyers.com/","support":"https://www.blackmyers.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":6,"unit":"GB","display":"6 GB","approximateBytes":6000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 6 GB"},"recommended":null},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Strategy","Early Access"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1195560","steamName":"Alek - The Lost Kingdom","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1195560/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:51:37.059042+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Alek, the young man who will change Zarabon's World forever. In this adventure, you must rebuild the world of Zarabon in your image. Build villages and manage your production lines with the help of your villagers.","detailedDescription":"🛡️ Rise to the destiny of a forgotten kingdom\n\nAlek The Lost Kingdom is an open-world role-playing game that immerses you in the universe of Zarabon.\n\nYou play as Alek, a hero you can embody as both a teenager and an adult, whose choices will shape the kingdom’s future. This world, scarred by war and chaos, awaits you to rise again from its ashes.\n\n🏰 Rebuild, manage... and dominate\n\nBuild your villages, restore lost cities, and develop your own production chain with the help of your villagers.\n\nExploit the kingdom’s resources: wood, ores, hides, wheat... and transform them to forge armor, weapons, and feed your people.\n\nNot to forget special armors and weapons, unique to certain factions or obtained under special conditions.\n\n🍲 Manage needs and professions\n\nYour villagers are hungry, work hard, and rely on you. Assign them to specific roles such as woodcutter, hunter, miner, baker, or blacksmith to ensure the survival and growth of your people.\n\nGrow your own vegetables, raise animals, cook nourishing meals, and maintain a vital balance between production and well-being.\n\n⚔️ Fight or negotiate with factions\n\nZarabon is home to several races, including humans and goblins. Other peoples will enrich this world in future updates.\n\nForge alliances… or declare war. Each faction has its own equipment, strategies, and ambitions.\n\nYour decisions will influence the balance of power and redefine the kingdom’s history.\n\n🧱 Build your empire, defend your people\n\nErect walls, build towers, and raise an army.\n\nRecruit warriors in your barracks — strong and effective in close combat — train archers for ranged attacks, and repel invaders.\n\nBut beware: your villages can be attacked at any time by outside enemies. To turn the tide, use the war table to declare conflicts, plan your offensives, and gain the upper hand over neighboring villages.\n\nYour survival will depend as much on your strategy as on your bravery.\n\n💰 Trade, a strategic lever\n\nTrade your surpluses, buy what you lack, and strengthen your economy.\n\nTrade is dynamic: convoys of horse-drawn carts travel across the kingdom, guided by your drivers to connect your cities or engage in commerce.\n\nEach transaction can affect your relations with neighbors. A good deal can spark a powerful alliance... or provoke the wrath of a rival faction.\n\nThe creatures of Zarabon\n\nThe world of Zarabon is filled with fearsome creatures:\n\n• The Yetis, masters of snowy peaks\n\n• The Werewolves, prowling deep forests\n\n• The Cave Trolls, guardians of forgotten passages\n\n• The Mammoths, titans of frozen plains\n\nBut some beasts can also become your allies: tame creatures such as the legendary Buckdjeuves, and roam the world atop formidable companions.\n\n🗡️ Evolving hero, exceptional enemies\n\nYour character progresses throughout the adventure: upgrade their equipment, unlock new abilities, and grow stronger with every battle.\n\nBut beware: the world is also filled with formidable bosses that will put your tactical skills to the test.\n\n🌟 A living world, constantly evolving\n\nThe world of Zarabon evolves with your choices. Nothing is set in stone.\n\nYour adventure will have a real impact on the environment, factions, and the balance of power.\n\nAlek The Lost Kingdom is a game in constant evolution, fueled by the passion of its community.\n\nJoin us, forge your legend, and leave your mark on the kingdom of Zarabon.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/bb12542c0cb401f0a1a2b0aa7a61884514fc16e9/header.jpg?t=1763909575"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/7c7e8d711bda949add57f94feeed977e579d6870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763909575"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/extras/4702fed8090ba1c66173989e36db4d0d.avif?t=1763909575","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/extras/558a22408b295bf344b7ed7e07f2d65d.avif?t=1763909575","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/extras/ac6c7b71efe103a609e2308cf23152f3.avif?t=1763909575","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/extras/3e52b3e55a0e5957ba5acb81c21fd6f8.avif?t=1763909575","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/extras/babd96bd0ddf0dbd233526a38641b956.avif?t=1763909575","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/22121ebbca5b81f3720ae544dabc4b9e4c403c39/ss_22121ebbca5b81f3720ae544dabc4b9e4c403c39.600x338.jpg?t=1763909575","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/22121ebbca5b81f3720ae544dabc4b9e4c403c39/ss_22121ebbca5b81f3720ae544dabc4b9e4c403c39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763909575"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/43ec686881ba1710d12ff9e070d32d541a523bef/ss_43ec686881ba1710d12ff9e070d32d541a523bef.600x338.jpg?t=1763909575","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/43ec686881ba1710d12ff9e070d32d541a523bef/ss_43ec686881ba1710d12ff9e070d32d541a523bef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763909575"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1195560/2